// chora.tenancy.v1 — Composable Add-On Plan events
// =============================================================================
//
// Source-of-truth: docs/architecture-review-inputs-2026-05-07.md Tier 1 D1
//   (Composable Add-On Plans, feature-flag driven, NOT tier pricing)
// + .claude/skills/monetization-patterns/SKILL.md
//
// Owning domain : Tenancy + Billing (chora_tenancy database)
// Owning team   : Team 3 (Platform)
// Topic prefix  : chora.tenancy.addon.*
//
// Add-Ons are composable feature toggles attached to a tenant — they are
// NOT pricing tiers. Each add-on plan exposes one or more capabilities
// (feature flags) and may carry usage-based metering (active learners,
// AI tokens, video minutes, certification issuances, etc.).
//
// IMPORTANT: DigitalSkin is NEVER a purchasable add-on. DigitalSkin is
// EARNED (via gameplay achievements in Content Sharing); see
// chora.sharing.* events. Add-on events here MUST NOT include digital_skin
// in addon_plan_id payloads.
//
// EVERY event message embeds chora.common.v1.EventEnvelope as field 1.
